*> Fixture for testing unrecognized completion contexts (ctxNone, Story 4, AC1).
*> Contains only non-triggering statements:
*> - COMPUTE (arithmetic operation)
*> - MOVE (data movement)
*> - comment lines
*> - blank lines
*>
*> A completion request at any line in this fixture should return an empty list,
*> not an error, demonstrating the ctxNone path (FR-43).

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #X (N3)
  1 #Y (N3)
  1 #Z (N3)
END-DEFINE

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  COMPUTE #X = 1 + 2
  MOVE 'HELLO' TO #Y
  *> This is a comment
  COMPUTE #Z = #X + #Y
END PROCEDURE.
